        <!-- ==================== GAMEPLAY ==================== -->
        <section id="gameplay" class="section">
            <h2>Gameplay</h2>

            <h3>Core Mechanics</h3>
            <p>Each level is a grid containing color-coded <strong>snakes</strong>, <strong>holes</strong>, and <strong>walls</strong>. The goal is to guide every snake into the hole that matches its color before the countdown timer reaches zero.</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Drag to move</strong> &mdash; Tap and drag a snake's head (or tail) to slide it along the grid, one cell at a time</li>
                <li><strong>Color matching</strong> &mdash; Each snake must enter the hole that shares its color</li>
                <li><strong>Walls</strong> &mdash; Impassable obstacles that block snake movement</li>
                <li><strong>Tail lock</strong> &mdash; Some snakes can only be moved by their head (tail movement is locked)</li>
                <li><strong>Timer</strong> &mdash; Each level has a time limit; running out triggers a Game Over</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Snake Colors</h3>
            <p>The game supports seven predefined snake/hole colors:</p>
