            <h3>Win &amp; Lose Conditions</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Win</strong> &mdash; All snakes are inside their matching holes. The level index advances and the next level loads automatically.</li>
                <li><strong>Lose</strong> &mdash; The timer reaches zero. The Game Over panel appears with a Retry button that reloads the current level.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Hole Animation</h3>
            <p>When a snake reaches its matching hole, it enters a segment-by-segment sucking animation. Each segment is removed on a timer while the visuals smoothly slide toward the hole. Colored particle bursts spawn at the hole entrance as segments are consumed.</p>
